      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This issue appeared firstly in the `unity-6` beta branch and then continued to progress in the `open-beta` branch after merging the `unity-6` beta branch after announcing it was ready for merging.\n\nDistribution doesn't matter in this case because fault is the same on different setups and use cases.\n\nI can only suggest (and guess) using the `git bisect` 5 patches before merging `unity-6` into `open-beta` and 2 patches after merging.\n\nDistribution: `Debian Forky/sid`.\n\nGraphical environment: KDE on Wayland.\n\nSteam installation: Non-flatpak.\n\nProton: 11 RTSP Fork.\n\nSLR: steamrt4.\n\nArchitecture: AMD64\n\nAll information about the fault has already been sent by the Unity crash handler.\n\nThe issue is already in the `release` branch.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
